OL,4,CMillions of people to see average      
OL,5,Cmonthly mortgage payments rise by #100 
OL,6,GMore people face higher mortgage       
OL,7,Grepayments when they roll off a fixed  
OL,8,Gdeal than previously estimated, new    
OL,9,Gfigures from the the Bank of England   
OL,10,Gshow.                                  
OL,12,FAbout 6.5 million owners are forecast  
OL,13,Fto see their monthly repayment jump by 
OL,14,F#100 on average when they move onto    
OL,15,Ftheir next deal by the end of 2029,    
OL,16,Fnew data in its Financial Stability    
OL,17,FReport reveals.                        
OL,19,FThat is more the double the #45-a-     
OL,20,Fmonth hike that the Bank estimated in  
OL,21,Fits last report in July.               
